  "details": "I noticed an issue with the Safety Shield settings. I have user icons above avatars disabled for **Visitors** and **New Users**, but their icons still appear when they are far away. This makes it impossible to distinguish them from **Known Users**, **Trusted Users**, or **Friends** at a distance, since they all end up showing icons.\n\nCould the icon visibility settings be applied consistently regardless of distance? If user icons are disabled for a trust rank, they shouldn't appear at any range.",
